  "releaseNotes": "- 1.2.6: Add address lookup from connected client SOCKET object\n      - 1.2.5: Add explicit Windows.h include where winsock2 is included (WinSock2First.h)\n      - 1.2.4: Fix rogue Windows.h include\n      - 1.2.3: Fix runtime library support build issues\n      - 1.2.2: Support more common runtime library settings\n      - 1.2.1: API cleanup, lifecycle refactoring, centralized TCP Server socket connections\n      - 1.2.0: API cleanup, TCP socket refactoring, normalized destruction\n      - 1.1.2: Update to NuGet package docs\n      - 1.1.1: API cleanup, better errors, string overloads",
